{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27081513","formula":"C₂₁H₂₂F₂N₆O₂","hill":"C21H22F2N6O2","elements":["H","C","N","O","F"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"F":2.0,"H":22.0,"N":6.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Larotrectinib","ru":"Ларотректиниб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Larotrectinib, sold under the brand name Vitrakvi, is a medication for the treatment of cancer. It is an inhibitor of tropomyosin kinase receptors TrkA, TrkB, and TrkC. It was discovered by Array BioPharma and licensed to Loxo Oncology in 2013. Larotrectinib was initially awarded orphan drug status in 2015, for soft tissue sarcoma, and breakthrough therapy designation in 2016 for the treatment of metastatic solid tumors with NTRK fusion.","ru":"Ларотректиниб, продаваемый под торговой маркой Vitrakvi, — лекарственный препарат, который применяют для лечения рака. В частности, его назначают в случаях, характеризующихся слиянием генов нейротрофического рецептора тирозинкиназы (NTRK). Ларотректиниб принимают внутрь."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":46188928,"mass":428.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C[C@@H](N(C1)C2=NC3=C(C=NN3C=C2)NC(=O)N4CC[C@@H](C4)O)C5=C(C=CC(=C5)F)F","inchikey":"NYNZQNWKBKUAII-KBXCAEBGSA-N","iupac":"(3S)-N-[5-[(2R)-2-(2,5-difluorophenyl)pyrrolidin-1-yl]pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyrimidin-3-yl]-3-hydroxypyrrolidine-1-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"46188928","atoms":53,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.885,"y":2.921,"z":-1.649,"el":"F"},{"x":2.605,"y":2.022,"z":3.465,"el":"F"},{"x":-4.99,"y":2.19,"z":-2.097,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.227,"y":-2.051,"z":0.631,"el":"O"},{"x":3.094,"y":-0.561,"z":-0.829,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.132,"y":0.16,"z":0.023,"el":"N"},{"x":0.937,"y":-1.216,"z":-0.36,"el":"N"},{"x":0.516,"y":-3.497,"z":0.27,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.171,"y":-1.115,"z":0.051,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.513,"y":-4.314,"z":0.619,"el